'''The Great Escaper''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Jail Break Tunnel]]. [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] resides here and can be unlocked as a [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance (guaranteed when using a Treasure Radar) whereas the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]] port has a guaranteed drop when beating the stage.

