*100 [[Squire Rel]]s (1,600%) spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 933.33 seconds<sup>28,000f</sup>, delay 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
